<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-29T21:54:51.288Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:54:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drone strikes have killed more than 100 civilians in a Darfur market and hit a power station, cutting electricity to two states. The Sudanese army is accused of launching 162 drone attacks from Ethiopian territory, which Ethiopia denies. Women are increasingly serving as frontline responders as the siege worsens and civilian arrests rise. A UN agency reports that nearly 120,000 people have been displaced in Blue Nile state since January. The UAE federal court sentenced eight Sudanese defendants to life imprisonment for illegal arms trafficking to the Sudanese army, according to the court.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168663&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1JY29RNmxnQ2xMMTJ4Yks4MFhSR3hJSkw2NmxyVkdINW0wbDNRMTRGaXhjNEZIQm9lVlFtM2ZiX2tqRExEdU96bWZ4U1VzRlVaemo3dm9FMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFA4Ml8zTWxDb3BONnN4dVZfZEkzWkx3cGpLMEpSRXZ5V3ZQSmFHYk8tazNKNjJIRFVRZl8xRGNmZG95NmVZTXMwRTJ5NWhyWExDVlBBLXBWbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNY1pCd0dZY3pDU3FNNXJ3LXlGUVE4RkVtQ040MlhOQktRV3JRQW8zZF9xTnluQjZFQUxKV09SV1NScjIydkxVREIyUmZINUNLM1I4X2pMd2RUNUZZQnRxRHRXckIxaVNPSHBvSnRxblc1TWpCYlRfdmltTmlXSFhZalE3cTEzZk9rUHdPRS1FVkZkUjkyZEt4eVpfZjE4ZUwwdlFnR2V6TmF3RXptMEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/